# Ever (Everwell Massage)

**Ever** = tenant `everwellmassage`, domain `everwellmassage.com.au` (also `www`).

## Product model

- Public site with a **simple booking form** (customer requests from the website).
- Admin receives **only bookings that came in from the site** — no walk-in / room / complex dayspa flows.
- **Do not link or share data with dayspa.** Separate tenant, separate bookings, separate branding.
- Keep the product **simple**: site → form → admin inbox. Avoid dayspa schedule/staff-portal complexity unless Ever explicitly needs it later.

## Naming

- In chat and docs, call this product **Ever** (에버).
- Code/DB slug stays `everwellmassage`; public brand **Everwell Wellness Massage** / Ever.
- Location: **Shop 8/640 S Pine Rd, Brendale QLD 4500** · Phone **0468 365 859**

## Code layout

All Ever UI and logic lives under **`src/features/ever/`** and routes under **`src/app/(ever)/`**.

Do **not** add Ever pages under `src/app/(landing)/` or AllBook platform paths. The canonical site is always **`https://everwellmassage.com.au`** — not `allbook.com.au/everwellmassage` (that path redirects to the custom domain).

## URLs

- Site (live): `https://everwellmassage.com.au`
- Design samples: `/rand/1`, `/rand/2`, `/rand/3` (Verdant selected); `/rand` mirrors the live landing
- Booking: `https://everwellmassage.com.au/booking`
- Admin: `https://everwellmassage.com.au/admin`

## Landing workflow

- **Selected direction: Verdant** — forest calm, soft gold, logo in header.
- The public homepage **`/`** serves the full Ever marketing site (`EverHomePage`).
- Do not put Ever marketing under AllBook platform paths.
